摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Best ready-to-run DeepSeek Harness distribution: DSH desktop GUI, DSH terminal TUI, and harness integration.","id":"gh:1334020974","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"cocode","slug":"cocode-agency/cocode","topics":["agent","byok","cocode","coding-agent","deepseek","deepseek-harness","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-plugin","free","tui","vibe-coding"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Best ready-to-run DeepSeek Harness distribution: DSH desktop GUI, DSH terminal TUI, and harness inte"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"dy-to-run DeepSeek Harness distribution: DSH desktop GUI, DSH terminal TUI, and harness integration."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Cocode"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A ready-to-run DeepSeek Harness distribution.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Most coding agents make the choices for you and take the choice away with them:\nwhich tools are avai"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"lable, how work gets scheduled, what the interface looks\nlike — all settled upstream. Cocode wants t"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"he other half of that bargain. It\nmakes the choices for you and leaves the screwdriver within reach:"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" the default\nsetup works the moment you install it, with nothing to study first, and when it\ndoesn't"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" fit you can open it up, see exactly how it was put together, and change\nit to your liking. Everythi"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ng else in Cocode follows from that."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The runtime underneath is DeepSeek Harness, which makes an argument of its own:\neverything is a plug"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"in. Models, tools, skills, sessions, sandboxes, and\nscheduling all come together through configurati"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"on, and Harness takes no\nposition on what you should assemble. Cocode assembles one of those, and pu"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ts\nthe assembly out in the open in the product instead of burying it in a config\nfile."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **Project status:** Developer preview. Cocode is built on the DeepSeek Harness\n> developer preview"},{"id":"p7s2","text":". It is an independent distribution, not an official DeepSeek\n> product, and upstream compatibility "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"may change. The repository supports source\n> builds on macOS, Windows, and Linux; the current releas"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"e scripts target macOS\n> and Windows artifacts, and this repository does not include a hosted backen"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"d or\n> a vendored Harness checkout."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install and try it in five minutes"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Use case | Install | Start |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| **GUI** | Download the installer for your platform from the GitHub Releases page. | Launch Cocode,"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" then choose Cocode Pro with hosted Nut credits or your own DeepSeek-compatible key. |\n| **TUI** | N"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ode.js `22.19.x` or later (`24+` is also supported), then `npm install --global @cocode-agency/tui`."},{"id":"p10s4","text":" | Run `cocode doctor`, then `cocode`. A real terminal is required. |\n| **From source** | Follow the"},{"id":"p10s5","text":" component-specific pnpm instructions below. | Use `make dev gui` or `make dev tui`. |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The published TUI package installs the matching `@cocode-agency/host-supervisor`\nautomatically. For "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"every release, keep `@cocode-agency/tui` and\n`@cocode-agency/host-supervisor` on the same version li"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ne; do not mix versions from\ndifferent releases. GUI installers are downloaded separately from the m"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"atching\nGitHub Release and are not installed through npm. The current repository is a\ndeveloper prev"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"iew, so release availability and upstream Harness compatibility\ncan change."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Five-minute first run"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Install the GUI from GitHub Releases, or run `npm install --global @cocode-agency/tui`.\n2. Start "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"the GUI, or run `cocode doctor` followed by `cocode` in a real TTY.\n3. Choose Cocode Pro / Cocode Nu"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"t, or enter your own DeepSeek-compatible API key.\n4. Open a workspace and ask the agent to inspect a"},{"id":"p13s4","text":" file or explain the project.\n5. If startup fails, save the output of `cocode doctor` and\n`cocode ho"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"st status --json` for troubleshooting. Remove credentials and\nprivate session data before sharing di"},{"id":"p13s6","text":"--json` for troubleshooting. Remove credentials and\nprivate session data before sharing diagnostics."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Why Cocode"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**The agent itself comes apart.** Which tools a session runs, what prompts it\ncarries, which capabil"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ities are on — that is a plugin assembly called a preset,\nand you can read its `agent.cordis.yml` ri"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"ght in the interface. Four presets\nship built in — Standard, PTC, Minimal, and Creator — and you cop"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"y one to make\nit yours. Elsewhere you get to swap the model. Here you get to swap the agent."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**A workspace, not a chat box.** Files, Git, a terminal, a built-in browser, and\ndiff previews sit a"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"longside the session. What the agent changed and what it ran\nis right there next to you, and you can"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" take over by hand at any point instead\nof carrying context between windows."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**The desktop and the terminal pick up the same session.** GUI and TUI connect\nto the same Host and "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"read and write the same session record. Push a task forward\nat your desk, then SSH in and continue f"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"rom the terminal — presentation state\nnever enters the session log, so any client can rebuild the fu"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"ll conversation\nfrom it."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**The model is your call too.** An official DeepSeek key, any OpenAI-compatible\nself-hosted or gatew"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ay endpoint, or Cocode Pro's hosted Cocode Nut service — all\nthree are available, and you can switch"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"r Cocode Pro's hosted Cocode Nut service — all\nthree are available, and you can switch between them."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Cocode is not trying to be another chat window. It won't parade a full chain of\nthought at you as a "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"feature, and it won't hand the model every tool by default.\nWhat it wants to be is a workspace you t"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"rust with real work — and one you can\nreshape to your own liking."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Two entry points, one session"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **Cocode GUI** | A desktop workspace built on Electron. Sessions, files, terminals, and runtime st"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ate live on one surface. Diffs and attachments open in a preview panel, so you see exactly what chan"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ged before you confirm. |\n| **Cocode TUI** | A terminal client for keyboard-first and remote work. S"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"SH into a machine and keep pushing tasks with no graphical environment required. |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Both attach to the same Host through `@cocode-agency/host-supervisor`, so they can share\nsessions an"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"d task state when they use the same `DSH_HOME`, profile, and Host\nconfiguration scope. Switching bet"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ween the desktop app and the terminal does\nnot reset your work within that scope."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### Cocode GUI"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### Cocode TUI"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Repository layout"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"This repository is not a single workspace. Each component is an independent\npnpm workspace with its "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"own lockfile and toolchain, tied together by a root\n`Makefile`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The runtime itself is not vendored here. `@cocode-agency/host-supervisor` pins\n`@deepseek-ai/dsh` fr"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"om npm and owns the Supervisor service, the local IPC and\nlease protocol, runtime-slot materializati"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"on, and the Cocode JSON-RPC Host\nplugin. GUI and TUI never launch a Harness process themselves — the"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"y acquire a\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The three components do not share a toolchain baseline. Check the one you plan\nto build:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Component | Node.js | pnpm |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| `cocode-gui` | `>=22.12.0` (see `.nvmrc`) | `10.34.5` exactly |\n| `cocode-tui` | `^22.19` or `>=24"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"` | any recent version |\n| `cocode-host-supervisor` | `>=22.12.0` | any recent version |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
